{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### [REQUIRED] Searched documentation and issues\r\nDocumentation reference:\r\n```java\r\n  /**\r\n   * Called when a frame is rendered for the first time since setting the surface, and when a frame\r\n   * is rendered for the first time since a video track was selected.\r\n   */\r\n  default void onRenderedFirstFrame() {}\r\n```\r\n\r\n### [REQUIRED] Question\r\nI'm getting `onRenderedFirstFrame` after seeking in buffered live progressive. Same result with `seekTo` (to the head - `minPlayabackBufferMs`) and `seekToDefaultPosition`.\r\n\r\n```\r\n12:40:05.216D/TimeShiftInMemory: Seeking to: 12:40:03.721 (pos: 275.94). Buffered: 280.94\r\n12:40:05.218D/EventLogger: seekStarted [eventTime=282.20, mediaPos=212.73, window=0, period=0]\r\n12:40:05.226D/EventLogger: positionDiscontinuity [eventTime=282.21, mediaPos=275.94, window=0, period=0, SEEK]\r\n12:40:05.318D/EventLogger: positionDiscontinuity [eventTime=282.30, mediaPos=0.00, window=0, period=0, SEEK_ADJUSTMENT]\r\n12:40:05.325D/EventLogger: state [eventTime=282.30, mediaPos=0.00, window=0, period=0, BUFFERING]\r\n12:40:05.345D/EventLogger: seekProcessed [eventTime=282.33, mediaPos=0.00, window=0, period=0]\r\n12:40:06.568D/EventLogger: renderedFirstFrame [eventTime=283.54, mediaPos=281.77, window=0, period=0, Surface(name=null)/@0xad1e4c]\r\n12:40:06.588D/EventLogger: state [eventTime=283.57, mediaPos=281.77, window=0, period=0, READY]\r\n```\r\n\r\nIs it expected behavior? Cause it does not match description from `onRenderedFirstFrame`. Or it's due missing implementation for https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/6562 ?\r\n\r\n### A full bug report captured from the device\r\n* https://drive.google.com/open?id=1EEYH0BmvWU0qiBmPSU3W5g7WocREBfAW\r\n\r\n### Link to test content\r\nit's live http progressive. I don't think that it's related to specific stream\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7097/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7097/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}